<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lin Television cut - source.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lin Television cut - source.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufking &amp; Jenrette cut its rating on LIN Television Corp to market perform from buy, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 3/4 at 40-1/4 in midmorning exchange trade.</p>
</text>
